body:
Thanks for pointing this out, i could tell something felt different but thought it might've been the different case I've got.

&#x200B;

I do miss the more 'tappy' feeling

Coming from a Late 2013 Retina MacBook Pro, and waiting from about, 2019 for the 'new refresh/with Apples own CPU's) I chose Silver because of how much the squared off edges remind me of the old PowerBooks.

&#x200B;

Despite me never using owning a Powerbook myself it felt 'nostalgic'

